g/patents).</p><p class="ForewordText"><a name="_53c3d577-039b-c4b5-9501-d397ca719bff" id="_53c3d577-039b-c4b5-9501-d397ca719bff"></a>Any trade name used in this document is information given for the convenience of users and does not constitute an endorsement.</p><p class="ForewordText"><a name="_0fef840f-1954-8758-f0ac-cc166dcae91d" id="_0fef840f-1954-8758-f0ac-cc166dcae91d"></a>For an explanation on the voluntary nature of standards, the meaning of ISO specific terms and expressions related to conformity assessment, as well as information about ISO&#x2019;s adherence to the World Trade Organization (WTO) principles in the Technical Barriers to Trade (TBT) see the following URL: www.iso.org/iso/foreword.html.</p><p class="ForewordText"><a name="_95eb09e1-9789-a11f-46f0-4bc741edfb55" id="_95eb09e1-9789-a11f-46f0-4bc741edfb55"></a>This document was prepared by Technical Committee ISO/TC 211,  <i>Geographic information/Geomantics</i>.</p><p class="ForewordText"><a name="_14bcb760-4b57-85c4-7e7c-c6c123867e9e" id="_14bcb760-4b57-85c4-7e7c-c6c123867e9e"></a>Any feedback or questions on this document should be directed to the user&#x2019;s national standards body. A complete listing of these bodies can be found at www.iso.org/members.html.</p></div><p class="MsoNormal">&#xA0;</p></div>
