<p class="Tabletitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 70&#xA0;&#x2014; Elements of &#x201C;Conceptual Observation schema::Host&#x201D; ()</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" width="100%"><a name="section-Interface-EAID_F112DC83_0BE5_47c6_923B_6425A82FAA4E" id="section-Interface-EAID_F112DC83_0BE5_47c6_923B_6425A82FAA4E"></a><tbody><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">Name</th><td colspan="7" valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7e2b7b91-f966-28cc-4f4e-ffeea08b2c71" id="_7e2b7b91-f966-28cc-4f4e-ffeea08b2c71"></a>Host</p>
</td></tr><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">Definition</th><td colspan="7" valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_67cd0d2a-d1ae-0b6b-f827-0056ccd4811f" id="_67cd0d2a-d1ae-0b6b-f827-0056ccd4811f"></a>a grouping of Observers for a specific reason.NOTES:</p>

<div class="ul_wrap" style="page-break-after:avoid"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo7;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_02fe4500-7170-e2e1-74d5-40ee840d7497" id="_02fe4500-7170-e2e1-74d5-40ee840d7497"></a>In many use cases, the Host is the environmental monitoring facility
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo7;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_f4d7a0d3-0cc5-4004-5b21-05476f325b84" id="_f4d7a0d3-0cc5-4004-5b21-05476f325b84"></a>The Host can be a platform that hosts a set of sensors
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo7;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><a name="_9d7e6919-6dd5-fef7-c939-140ebf2251ca" id="_9d7e6919-6dd5-fef7-c939-140ebf2251ca"></a>An alternative usage could pertain to a biodiversity survey campaign; in this scenario, the team performing the survey would be modelled as observers whereas the entire survey campaign can be represented as a Host.
</p>
</div>
</td></tr><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">Stereotype</th><td colspan="7" valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_354d8931-4daa-06a4-ee02-525700264c81" id="_354d8931-4daa-06a4-ee02-525700264c81"></a>interface</p>
</td></tr><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">Abstract</th><td colspan="7" valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8042f61a-850d-cef6-e520-ced6788fd48d" id="_8042f61a-850d-cef6-e520-ced6788fd48d"></a>True</p>
